s/texas/wharton-county"],["ARC or PLC in Wharton County","/arc-plc/texas/wharton-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, March to April came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids in Wharton County. In 2025 the middle ran 38% of normal in September to October and 41% of normal in October to November. In 2026 so far, April to May came in at 165% of normal on the middle. Grid 11235 had its driest year in 2011 at 41% of normal.</p>"}
